{"id":2730,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><div><p>4月21日下午，中北大学2026年微团课宣讲比赛校赛决赛在经济与管理学院（逸夫楼）三楼会议室301举行，我院吴媛同学凭借扎实的理论功底、生动的宣讲表达在比赛中斩获一等奖。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Wn77HYMzWkM8l8Mg8V2nmLYnzNYM8ULiUlLDUlnRU4G8nNU0gihFp2hmCIa0MShkUSy4Mkhknm-iLl-4nmN8nmvbU4NYL7VRL4GYMzvanRfFnRQVMNLZnmAFM4L8Ul-Jqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CZMRlJqdMnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6845&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/5BA34BF251B3F94F79C920AC302570D0/D6E6C8F8/734AB\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=WoRWHVnllZnlnRog7rVUzWkM8WVMRvLZn7lDL7W7nmf2U4U0gihFp2hmCIa0MShkL1ysU1yYM8Q7M87YLzNDoRUDol7sUNWRnN7anzM7UlWFL7VRnRARnR6FnNCbUm6VgtXaQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGaL1yDoRUigtA8pUMcc&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6845&e=.jpg\"></p><p>此次优异成绩的取得，既是吴媛同学个人努力的成果，也彰显了我院共青团工作和青年思想引领工作的扎实成效。希望全院团员青年以吴媛同学为榜样，坚定理想信念，锤炼品德修为，在理论学习与实践锻炼中不断提升自我，勇担时代使命，为学院和学校高质量发展贡献青春力量。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=WM8CHsLmffU4UYngzvinz7inRLYU8lLZUzNinz9ZM8r2nz-0gihFp2hmCIa0nSy8nSyDM1hfnmlZMRTfM7nkM7CsMNC8U8CsL8LDMzUYnRTFMNnknzrfUNrFL4L4nRUJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CZMRlJqdMnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6845&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/E4E66AF5849A4DB4F76F4CF73C6542D9/6DBE5ABE/333D4\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=WU49HiM4UYUlLYMglVkolQfMRlDLl7L8MRlZn7-YnNQVLz70gihFp2hmCIa0U1hfMYhVMYh2LR7aMmvsol-an7lZU4-boRGsLmGaLm-inznFL4M7oRlanNnFU4V7LllJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CZMRlJqdMnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6845&e=.jpg\"></p><p><br></p></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://mkszyxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Wn77HYMzWkM8l8Mg8V2nmLYnzNYM8ULiUlLDUlnRU4G8nNU0gihFp2hmCIa0MShkUSy4Mkhknm-iLl-4nmN8nmvbU4NYL7VRL4GYMzvanRfFnRQVMNLZnmAFM4L8Ul-Jqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CZMRlJqdMnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6845&e=.jpg"}